# Spacemacs Config Agent Guide

This workspace (`~/.emacs.d`) is the user's personal Spacemacs installation. The user runs Emacs as their primary IDE and considers Spacemacs "brittle" — be cautious, incremental, test before committing. **Read this entire file before making any changes.**

## Repo layout (critical)

